{
  "file_id": "ID03602",
  "text_count": 88,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "��������Taichi! It's the Koromon village!",
      "_offset": 1505,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "Yeah. Although we were just here,\nit feels like we've been away for\na long time.",
      "_offset": 1547,
      "_length": 80,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "Taichi...",
      "_offset": 1628,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "So, why'd you say we should return\nto the Koromon village?",
      "_offset": 1638,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "It was my idea.",
      "_offset": 1697,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "Sora?",
      "_offset": 1713,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "There might be a way to get\nKoromon to evolve again.",
      "_offset": 1719,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "After all, not only was there a\nCrest hidden here, but there was\nalso a transfer device.",
      "_offset": 1772,
      "_length": 88,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "There's prolly some kinda legend\n'bout evolution here, too.",
      "_offset": 1861,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Thanks, guys! Thanks for coming,\nfor me and Koromon!",
      "_offset": 1921,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Cheer up, Taichi.",
      "_offset": 1974,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Yeah. I can't stay down forever.",
      "_offset": 1992,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "That's right, Taichi!",
      "_offset": 2025,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Now, let's listen to what the\nKoromon have to say.",
      "_offset": 2047,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "...so that's why.",
      "_offset": 2098,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Do you know of any way to get\nKoromon to evolve again?",
      "_offset": 2116,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Unfortunately, we don't have any\nlegends about evolution.",
      "_offset": 2171,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "If there were a way, we would have\nused it already.",
      "_offset": 2229,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "Yeah, you're right.",
      "_offset": 2281,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "But that's bad. It means you won't\nbe able to evolve again, right?",
      "_offset": 2301,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "That might just be how it is...",
      "_offset": 2368,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Ah, now that you mention it...",
      "_offset": 2400,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "D-did you come up with something?",
      "_offset": 2431,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "It's got nothing to do with\nevolution, but I do know a legend\nabout invigoration medicine.",
      "_offset": 2465,
      "_length": 90,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "Invigoration medicine?",
      "_offset": 2556,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Yeah! If you drink it when you get\nsick, you'll feel a great power\nfrom your body!",
      "_offset": 2579,
      "_length": 82,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "So where is this medicine?",
      "_offset": 2662,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "We can make it for you if you\nbring us DigiPinecones!",
      "_offset": 2689,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "They grow on the farthest tree\nfrom the village.",
      "_offset": 2743,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "Let's go, guys! I'll do anything\nfor Koromon!",
      "_offset": 2792,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "That's the spirit, Taichi!",
      "_offset": 2838,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "Taichi, that must be it!",
      "_offset": 2865,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "So those are DigiPinecones!",
      "_offset": 2890,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "We did it, Taichi! Let's hurry\nback to the Koromon village.",
      "_offset": 2918,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "Wait right there!",
      "_offset": 2978,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "Gazimon!",
      "_offset": 2996,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "What do you want?",
      "_offset": 3005,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Don't you know who this tree\nbelongs to?",
      "_offset": 3023,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "It grew from seeds we threw on the\nroadside a long time ago! In other\nwords, those pinecones are ours!",
      "_offset": 3064,
      "_length": 102,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "That is *such* a blatant lie!",
      "_offset": 3167,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Shut up!",
      "_offset": 3197,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Gyah!",
      "_offset": 3206,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Gyah!",
      "_offset": 3212,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "Sora!",
      "_offset": 3218,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Don't do such horrible things to\nmy friends!",
      "_offset": 3224,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "How's that? Wanna go again?",
      "_offset": 3269,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Tch! I'll remember this!",
      "_offset": 3297,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Are you okay, Sora?",
      "_offset": 3322,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "It's no big deal. Let's go back to\nthe Koromon village.",
      "_offset": 3342,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "Sorry to keep you waiting! Here's\nthe invigoration medicine.",
      "_offset": 3398,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Go on, chug it down in one shot!",
      "_offset": 3459,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "Let's go! *gulp*...*gulp*",
      "_offset": 3492,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "*gulp, gulp*",
      "_offset": 3518,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "*gulp, gulp*",
      "_offset": 3531,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "*gulp, gulp*",
      "_offset": 3544,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "So how was it?",
      "_offset": 3557,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "G-grooooooss!",
      "_offset": 3577,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "Bleeeeeh, it tastes terrible.",
      "_offset": 3591,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "That's strange, I'm sure we made\nit correctly...",
      "_offset": 3621,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "You're awful for making us drink\nthat!",
      "_offset": 3670,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "Awful! Awful!",
      "_offset": 3709,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "Well, you certainly look\ninvigorated... with anger.",
      "_offset": 3723,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "Perhaps it was meant to be\nsomething like shock therapy.",
      "_offset": 3775,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "We only heard legends about this,\nwe really didn't know... Please\ntake this in apology.",
      "_offset": 3832,
      "_length": 87,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "Hmph, all right, give it to us.",
      "_offset": 3920,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "Sorry, Taichi. This wouldn't have\nhappened if I hadn't suggested\nthat we come here.",
      "_offset": 3952,
      "_length": 83,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "It's okay, it's the thought that\ncounts. Despite all that happened,\nit really meant a lot.",
      "_offset": 4036,
      "_length": 90,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "So don't worry about it.",
      "_offset": 4127,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "That's right. I hope you feel like\nyourself again, Taichi.",
      "_offset": 4152,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "We can make the invigoration\nmedicine if we have DigiPinecones.",
      "_offset": 4211,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "The DigiPinecones grow on the\nfarthest tree from the village.",
      "_offset": 4275,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "If we could evolve, we'd have\ntaken care of the Pagumon and\nEtemon ourselves...",
      "_offset": 4337,
      "_length": 79,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "Huh? Weren't you an Agumon back\nthen?",
      "_offset": 4417,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "Yeah. A lot of stuff happened...",
      "_offset": 4455,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "Etemon came here and destroyed\nthis town, too. Look at this road!",
      "_offset": 4492,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "We have legends about how to make\na variety of medicines.",
      "_offset": 4558,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "Hey, Jou, can you teach me how to\nmake mouthwash?",
      "_offset": 4616,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "Eh, why me?",
      "_offset": 4666,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "Because you're always shouting.",
      "_offset": 4678,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "That's enough from you!",
      "_offset": 4710,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "I've just been bothering everyone,\nin the end.",
      "_offset": 4734,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "What are you saying, Taichi?!",
      "_offset": 4781,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "You've always been getting us out\nof trouble!",
      "_offset": 4811,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "Sora...",
      "_offset": 4857,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "So right now, we have to help you,\ntoo.",
      "_offset": 4865,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "What Sora said!",
      "_offset": 4905,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "Don't act like you're bothering\nus.",
      "_offset": 4921,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "Sorry, Sora. Thanks, guys!",
      "_offset": 4957,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    }
  ]
}